  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Maternal and Neonatal Health Service System in Bangladesh Rangpur Division</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Improve awareness and education/promotion(Use ANC, PNC, and facility delivery services, and gender equality/sexual reproductive self determination of women of reproductive age, including adolescent pregnant women, Reproductive health and family planning for husband and parents in law)  2. Mitigate gaps in health personnel vacancies and strengthen capabilities(Mitigate FWVs vacancies and assist in deployment, Comprehensive human capacity building (including professional/support/administrative personnel, Advocate for government to encourage health workers to work in vulnerable areas, Reinforce health data collection system and utilization capabilities .3. Improve the infrastructure of health facilities, Renovate health facilities and enhance the functions for 24/7 operation, Establish WASH facility in health facilities, Provide essential medicines/medical supplies/equipment .4. Improve medical accessibility and emergency referral system</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the maternal and neonatal health service system in the Rangpur Division of Bangladesh to promote healthy and safe deliveries.1. &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED;&#xC8FC;&#xBBFC;&#xC758; &#xAC74;&#xAC15;&#xD55C; &#xCD9C;&#xC0B0;&#xC5D0; &#xB300;&#xD55C; &#xC778;&#xC2DD; &#xBC0F; &#xD589;&#xB3D9; &#xAC1C;&#xC120;, 2. &#xC0B0;&#xC804; &#xD6C4; &#xAD00;&#xB9AC;/&#xC2DC;&#xC124;&#xBD84;&#xB9CC; &#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4; &#xC774;&#xC6A9;&#xB960; &#xC99D;&#xAC00;, 3. &#xD30C;&#xD2B8;&#xB108;&#xC2ED;&#xC0AC;&#xC5C5;&#xC758; &#xAC1C;&#xBC1C;&#xD6A8;&#xACFC;&#xC131; &#xC99D;&#xB300;, 4. (&#xD544;&#xC218;) &#xC815;&#xBD80; &#xAD6D;&#xC81C;&#xAC1C;&#xBC1C;&#xD611;&#xB825; &#xC815;&#xCC45;/&#xC804;&#xB7B5;&#xC801; &#xBAA9;&#xD45C; &#xB2EC;&#xC131;&#xC5D0; &#xAE30;&#xC5EC;, 5. (&#xD544;&#xC218;) &#xCC38;&#xC5EC; &#xC8FC;&#xCCB4;&#xC758; &#xC5ED;&#xB7C9; &#xC99D;&#xB300;</narrative>
  </description>
